        <p>
          The selection between sacrificial and permanent anti-graffiti coating strategies is determined by the substrate type, graffiti frequency, cleaning infrastructure availability, budget, and any heritage conservation constraints. Neither system is universally superior — each is optimal for specific asset categories and use environments. The table below provides a direct technical comparison of the key parameters that govern anti-graffiti coating system selection.
